- **Task tracking**: Marked T114 complete in `specs/001-develop-streaming-indicators/tasks.md` and updated progress counters (50/85 StreamHub implementations, 72% streaming coverage)

## Usage

```csharp
// Buffer-style incremental processing
FisherTransformList fisherList = new(lookbackPeriods);
foreach (IQuote quote in quotes) { fisherList.Add(quote); }

// StreamHub for advanced scenarios
QuoteHub quoteHub = new();
FisherTransformHub observer = quoteHub.ToFisherTransformHub(lookbackPeriods);
foreach (Quote quote in quotes) { quoteHub.Add(quote); }
IReadOnlyList<FisherTransformResult> results = observer.Results;
```

Implementation at `src/e-k/FisherTransform/FisherTransform.StreamHub.cs` includes rolling window optimization (RollingWindowMax/Min) and state rollback support for Insert/Remove operations.

