This PR implements schema filtering through selection query.

```shell
s2dm compose -s /path/to/schema [--selection-query | -q] /path/to/selection/query -o composed_schema.graphql
```

Example selection query:

```graphql
query Selection {
  Vehicle(instance: "instance") {
    Speed
    Location {
      Latitude
      Longitude
    }
  }
}
```

